  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You take the impact in your back, against the lower spine. The heat temporarily stuns your spinal cord and you collapse as you lose all control and feeling in both legs!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Prone], as well as @Condition[Ablaze] (1), or one additional level if you are already Ablaze. Both your legs are useless (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.k00PimCWkff11IA0]{Amputated Parts}). At the end of each turn you may roll a <strong>Hard (-20) Endurance</strong> Test to regain use of your legs. Apart from that, any Athletics Test you take to remove @Condition[Ablaze] Conditions will be one level harder while your legs are out of action.</p>"
    },
